I am not familiar with Mac OSX, but if it treats the file permissions
anything like unix, the game needs the execute permission to your home
directory and read permission to the .nethackrc file there.

chmod a+x ~
chmod a+r ~/.nethackrc

Those commands should do the trick.
The world execution permission to your home directory means that others
can read the files in your home directory by name if they have read
permissions for them, but it doesn't allow listing the directory if you
don't give read permission for it.

